}],"source":["if len(sev_oof):\n","    sev_track = summarise_sev(sev_oof, \"track\")\n","    sev_track.to_csv(OUT / \"tables/partC_severity_track.csv\", index=False)\n","    cmp = sev_box.groupby(\"arm\").QWK.mean().to_frame(\"QWK_box\").join(sev_track.groupby(\"arm\").QWK.mean().rename(\"QWK_track\"))\n","    cmp[\"gain\"] = cmp.QWK_track - cmp.QWK_box; display(cmp.round(3))\n","\n","    sens = []\n","    for md in (20, 40, 80):\n","        tracks_alt = link_tracks(boxes.drop(columns=\"track\"), max_dist=md)[[\"uid\", \"track\"]]\n","        o = sev_oof.drop(columns=\"track\").merge(tracks_alt, on=\"uid\")\n","        s = summarise_sev(o[o.arm == \"cnn_raw+desc\"], \"track\")\n","        sens.append(dict(max_dist=md, n_tracks=tracks_alt.track.nunique(), QWK_track=s.QWK.mean()))\n","    display(pd.DataFrame(sens).round(3))\n","else:\n","    sev_track, cmp = pd.DataFrame(), pd.DataFrame(); print(\"no severity runs yet - Part C skipped\")\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"5dd20648","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.028978,"end_time":"2026-10-26T04:02:42.350405+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-26T04:02:42.321427+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 11. Part D: how much does the split choice inflate results? (leakage experiment)\n","\n","The same severity model (`cnn_raw`) is evaluated under three splitting regimes with otherwise identical settings:\n","- **frame-random**: boxes split at random, so the same lesion and patient appear in train and test (what many papers effectively do);\n","- **video-grouped**: no video in both sets, but the same patient (different projections) can be;\n","- **patient-grouped**: the correct protocol.\n","\n","The gap between regimes estimates how optimistic leaky protocols are on CADICA. The severity model is used because it is cheap. The detector can be checked the same way later by passing frame-level groups to `make_outer_folds`."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":16,"id":"ecc6aeb3","metadata":